# The repository's own text is stored and checked out with LF on every
# platform, so a Windows clone is byte-identical to a macOS one. Tests that
# parse these files, and hashes taken over them, therefore agree everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Public source fixtures are hash-checked against their original bytes.
# Preserve line endings and keep large model exports out of source-code diffs.
test/fixtures/drawings/*.ifc -text -diff
test/fixtures/drawings/*.xml -text -diff
test/fixtures/drawings/*.pdf -text -diff
